@startuml
' Lab 01 — Actores y límite del sistema
' Renderiza: plantuml -tsvg starter/biblioteca.puml
title Biblioteca — actores del sistema de préstamos

left to right direction

' Candidatos a actor sacados del enunciado. No todos lo son.
actor Ana
actor Librarian
actor Database
actor "Loan Module" as LoanModule

usecase "Borrow book" as CU01
usecase "Renew loan" as CU02
usecase "Pay fine" as CU03
usecase "Send overdue reminders" as CU04

Librarian -- CU01

